## 待审文本（按字段）
{
 "reply": "Dear Jenna,\n\nThank you for your inquiry. We can supply the 500ml double-wall vacuum tumbler for your 2,000-piece order. Laser engraving your logo is free for orders of 1,000 pieces or more.\n\nFor 2,000 pieces, our price is USD 4.10 per piece FOB Ningbo. The standard lead time is 30 days, so we cannot confirm delivery within 25 days. We quote FOB Ningbo only; DDP Los Angeles would need a separate quotation from a freight forwarder, and we cannot guarantee the door-to-door price or transit time. Payment terms are 30% T/T deposit and 70% against B/L copy, or L/C at sight.\n\nRegarding compliance and product claims: we do not have an FDA food-contact test report. We can provide the available LFGB test report for the 304 stainless-steel body and PP lid. The lid is PP, and we have only a BPA-free declaration from the raw-material supplier, not a third-party test report for the finished lid.\n\nThe tumbler keeps ice for about 24 hours based on our internal test; we do not have a third-party performance report. The powder-coated exterior is hand-wash only and is not dishwasher safe, so the dishwasher-safe claim on your listing would not match this product.\n\nWe can send a free sample; international shipping is at the buyer’s expense. Please let us know whether the FOB price, 30-day lead time, and hand-wash care instructions work for you, and share your logo artwork if you would like us to prepare the laser engraving details.\n\nBest regards"
}
